# inc-w91w: throw the wielded dagger at the EMPTY square of a found trap,
# three squares east: the throw key's "Throw what?" menu, then the location
# cursor. Same `s` and lowercase-f notes as trap-shot-loc.keys.
# The probe wields the dagger with an empty off hand, and the game asks.
@while "two-handed" n
@while "-- more --" SPACE
s
f
@dump:throw-menu
a
l
RIGHT*3
@dump:shot-cursor
ENTER
@while "Really throw" y
@while "-- more --" SPACE
@dump:shot-after
@quit
